{"availability":"available","full":"HMarzban/claude-mod","name":"claude-mod","description":"See what your next Claude Code message costs: a live band above the prompt with the prompt-cache countdown, the re-warm price, session cost, context and 5h/weekly usage limits.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":4,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-09T09:30:26Z","updated":"2026-10-15T07:09:59Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://hmarzban.github.io/claude-mod/","topics":["anthropic","claude","claude-ai","claude-code","claude-code-plugin","claude-mod","cost-tracking","developer-tools","llm-tools","prompt-caching","rate-limits","token-usage","usage-limits"],"demo":"https://hmarzban.github.io/claude-mod/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T07:10:42.103Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T07:10:42.103Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T07:10:42.103Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T07:26:49.134Z","stars":4,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T07:10:42.103Z","stars":4,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Know what your next Claude Code message costs.","A live band above the Claude Code prompt: the prompt-cache countdown, what a re-warm will cost, the session's spend, context fill, and your 5-hour and weekly limits.","Step away from Claude Code longer than its prompt cache lasts (5 minutes or an hour after the last request) and your next message writes the whole conversation to the cache again, at more than the full input price. On a long conversation that's a dollar or more, and nothing in Claude Code tells you it's coming. While the cache is warm, each message re-reads the conversation on Anthropic's side at a fraction of the input price."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HMarzban/claude-mod/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"0afc43a4ed4262df2dd8f8ce5cc7d0d3305758c7f4d3e312d30dab953024af4d","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:49.212Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:49.21